  "kelly-guan": {
    title: "Social Chair",
    currentName: "Kelly Guan",
    currentMeta: "Social Chair | 2026",
    whatToKnow: `
      <strong>Catering Orders</strong>
      <p>When emailing vendors, include the following:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name and the club you are representing</li>
        <li>Date, time, and whether it's pickup or delivery</li>
        <li>If delivery: school address is <strong>9500 Gilman Drive, La Jolla, CA 92093</strong>. Request the dropoff at Jacobs Hall (EBU1) so you don't have to walk from Price Center</li>
        <li>Phone number, email, or other contact info</li>
      </ul>

      <strong>Budgeting Tips</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Factor in delivery fee and sales tax so the <strong>price per person does not exceed $10</strong></li>
        <li>Example: subtotal $100 + tax $7.75 + delivery $12.50 = $120.25 &divide; 10 = ~$12/person &rarr; round up to 13 people</li>
      </ul>

      <strong>Payment</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>NO need to put a credit card down. Explain that a student government representative will send payment <strong>24&ndash;72 hours before</strong> the event</li>
        <li>If there is any confusion, ask your exec for help</li>
      </ul>

      <strong>Using AS Funding at Vons/Ralphs/Costco</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the grocery app or website to build an online order</li>
        <li>Screenshot the cart and use it as your invoice</li>
      </ul>

      <strong>Room Bookings</strong>
      <p><strong>Price Center (PC):</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Only exec officers can book PC rooms, up to 4 confirmed reservations at a time</li>
        <li>Recommend sticking with <strong>floor 2</strong> &mdash; floor 4 rooms are harder to find and fewer people show up</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Jacobs Hall (EBU1):</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>ECE facilities can take up to <strong>5 days</strong> to return your confirmation &mdash; plan ahead</li>
        <li>Post directions to classroom 2315, especially for joint events with other clubs where students may not know the building</li>
      </ul>
    `,
