  "lauren-vo": {
    title: "Marketing Chair",
    currentName: "Lauren Vo",
    currentMeta: "Marketing Chair | 2026",
    whatToKnow: `
      <strong>Marketing Structure</strong>
      <p>Marketing covers two areas &mdash; media and photography:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Media</strong> &mdash; promoting through social media: Discord, Instagram, Facebook, newsletters</li>
        <li><strong>Photography</strong> &mdash; capturing content at events for recaps and future promotion</li>
      </ul>

      <strong>Pre-Event Process</strong>
      <ol>
        <li>Receive event requests &mdash; <strong>enforce that they're submitted at least 6 weeks in advance</strong></li>
        <li>Create graphics (flyer, FB, IG)</li>
        <li>Send graphics to the PR team for feedback</li>
        <li>Send graphics to whoever requested for approval</li>
        <li>Create posts on social media platforms</li>
        <li>Promote those posts (see below)</li>
      </ol>

      <strong>Where to Cross-Promote</strong>
      <p><strong>Facebook:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Class of 20XX groups</li>
        <li>IEEE UC San Diego Branch Members</li>
        <li>TESC Outreach &mdash; Incoming UCSD Freshmen</li>
        <li>What's Happening @ UCSD</li>
        <li>Others: UCSD Free Food Brigade, CS @ UCSD, EE @ UCSD, CSES</li>
        <li>Anywhere else that might be helpful</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Instagram</strong> &mdash; DM for story reshares:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>@ucsandiegoece, @ucsandiegoengineering, @eceusc_ucsd</li>
        <li>Others: @acm.ucsd, @hkn_ucsd, @pibucsd, @qcucsd, @tntucsd, @swe.ucsd, @ucsdtesc, @sphbeucsd, @shpeatucsd, @girlswhocodeucsd, @ostemucsd, @bwiucsd, @saseatucsd</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Discord</strong> &mdash; post in: U[CS]D, UCSD Cog Sci Study Group, UCSD LGBTQIA+, HKN Kappa Psi, ACM UC San Diego, oSTEM @ UCSD, Computer Science &amp; Engineering Society, Women in Computing @ UCSD, Class of 20XX. Get help from all officers &mdash; they may be in other servers that you aren't in to help promote, especially STEM-adjacent and non-STEM groups (Math, MAE, Robotics, etc.)</p>
      <p><strong>Newsletters:</strong> IEEE, ECE, IDEA</p>

      <strong>Physical Flyers</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the <strong>'23&ndash;'24 Marketing Masterlist</strong> (Google Doc) as a reference</li>
        <li>If someone (probably me/Brigette) would order them through Triton Print and Digital Media, pay out of pocket, pick up at the Campus Services Complex, then submit an AS reimbursement for the flyers</li>
        <li>Whoever ordered them (they have to be a Principal Member) submits the AS reimbursement</li>
      </ul>

      <strong>During the Event &mdash; Photography</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Coordinate with one another &mdash; as well as the officers who want to take pictures &mdash; so no one is doubling up for too long</li>
        <li>Real cameras preferred, but phone cameras are fine</li>
      </ul>

      <strong>During the Event &mdash; Stories</strong>
      <p>Post on FB and IG stories. It'd be nice to revamp our story highlights to make them relevant.</p>

      <strong>Post-Event</strong>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Photography</strong> &mdash; upload photos to IEEE's Google Photos (create a new album)</li>
        <li>Pick at most 10 photos you think are worthy enough to post on social media for a recap</li>
        <li>Edit them if they need it and add our logo/watermark</li>
        <li>Post the recap on social media accounts</li>
      </ol>

      <strong>General Expectations</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>Weekly OAH (2 hours), Weekly Internal Meeting (1 hour), Working Mandatory Events</li>
        <li>Bi-Quarterly All Hands (1&ndash;3 hours), Quarterly GBMs (1&ndash;3 hours, recap videos &amp; collages)</li>
        <li>Posting on Instagram &amp; Discord (~1 hour), attending events for photo/video (1&ndash;3 hours)</li>
      </ul>
    `,
